    "rep.s4": "4. Test results",
    "rep.code.tests": "$ cargo test --workspace   →  252 passed (13 crates)\n\nprotocol 22 · sim 31 · spatial 6 · net 5 · shard 9 · persist 14\neconomy 27 · combat 17 · render 37 · script 32 · build 15 · server 31 · client 6\n\n$ cargo run -p ou-combat --bin ou-combat-demo\n=== Hit chance (1000 shots) ===\n  autocannon  range 1500:  97%  80%  62%  44%  31%\n=== Duel: laser vs railgun ===\n  tick 27: shield 0 (0%), armor 0 (0%)  ← destroyed\n\n$ cargo run -p ou-economy --bin ou-market-demo\n  trade: seller 2 → buyer 9, 60 units at 25 (total 1500)\nVWAP = 26 · Trades in the log: 2\n\n$ cargo run -p ou-render --release -- voxel 900 506\n  voxel      900×506  17.44 s\n\n$ cargo run -p ou-render --release -- dig 640 360\n  dig        2 frames → 1280×360  18.52 s  -> render-dig.png\n\n$ cargo run -p ou-server --bin ou-netd -- 127.0.0.1:7777 10 &\n$ cargo run -p ou-render --release --bin ou-netrender -- 127.0.0.1:7777 8 4\n  baseline received: 1 · deltas: 236 · saved 4 frames -> render-net.png",
    "rep.s5": "5. What's next",
    "rep.next1": "Networked rendering — draw incoming UDP snapshots in real time. ✓",
    "rep.next2": "Landing a ship on a voxel surface (linking physics and terrain). ✓",
    "rep.next3": "Sharding: migrating state between nodes (currently routing).",
    "rep.next4": "Kubernetes and autoscaling (the only Phase 3 item left).",
    "rep.next5": "Lua scripting for constructions (Phase 8). ✓",
